  "prefLabel": "Cmp 102.01 Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cmp 102.01 Commission. The commission is established under RSA 188-F:58 and has rulemaking authority under RSA 188-F:62, VII, relative to the rights and responsibilities of parties utilizing the planetarium facilities. Fees for planetarium use are set and collected by the commission under the provisions of RSA 188-F:62, III.\n\nSource. #7368, eff 9-27-00",
